	SYSTEM OPERATION:

	/A	INCLUDE PRINTOUT OF STATUS OF "STIMULUS RELATED"HISTOGRAMS.
		0:	NOT PRESENT
		1:	HISTOGRAM OF FIRST STIMULUS X, Y
		2:	HISTOGRAM OF SECOND STIMULUS X, Y
		3:	HISTOGRAM OF THIRD STIMULUS X, Y
		(ALSO MEANS HISTOGRAMS WILL BE CREATED ON UNIT 4 OF THE DISK).

	/B	GENERATE HISTOGRAM ON EACH MOVEMENT (FROM 409.6 MS BEFORE THE
		CURRENT BEGINNING OF MOVEMENT).

	/C	INCLUDE PRINTOUT OF STATUS OF MOVEMENT.

		0:	NORMAL
		1:	IS IMPOSSIBLE
		2:	EXAMINED (E.G. OFF-TARGET)
		3:	ON-TARGET (I.E. AND EXAMINED)
					>	XLIST	ON
